  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.outreach.body', 'en', 'Interactive hearing health seminars and workshops for senior centers, assisted living facilities, community groups, and families. Topics cover hearing loss impacts, practical communication strategies, reducing stigma, and fostering inclusive environments.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.outreach.body', 'zhHant', '為銀髮中心、輔助生活機構、社區團體與家庭舉辦互動式聽力健康講座——涵蓋聽力損失的影響、實用溝通策略、消除偏見與營造包容環境。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.outreach.body', 'zhHans', '为老年中心、辅助生活机构、社区团体与家庭举办互动式听力健康讲座——涵盖听力损失的影响、实用沟通策略、消除偏见与营造包容环境。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.outreach.title', 'en', 'Community Outreach & Seminars', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.outreach.title', 'zhHant', '社區推廣與講座', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.outreach.title', 'zhHans', '社区推广与讲座', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.tutoring.body', 'en', 'Free, personalized English communication sessions delivered via Zoom by trained high school volunteers, for students with hearing loss and other communication needs (including ASD and underrepresented ESL learners). AI-assisted lesson plans are built on professional session guides with input from speech-language pathologists.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.tutoring.body', 'zhHant', '由受過訓練的高中志工透過 Zoom 提供免費、個人化的英語溝通課程——服務聽力損失及其他溝通需求的學生（包括自閉症譜系與需要協助的 ESL 學習者）。AI 輔助的課程計畫以專業教案為基礎，並參考言語治療師的意見。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.tutoring.body', 'zhHans', '由受过训练的高中志愿者通过 Zoom 提供免费、个性化的英语沟通课程——服务听力损失及其他沟通需求的学生（包括自闭症谱系与需要帮助的 ESL 学习者）。AI 辅助的课程计划以专业教案为基础，并参考言语治疗师的意见。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.tutoring.title', 'en', 'One-on-One English Tutoring', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.tutoring.title', 'zhHant', '一對一英語輔導', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'programs.services.tutoring.title', 'zhHans', '一对一英语辅导', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
