  ('/__global__', 'shared.donate.line', 'en', 'Any amount directly supports our mission, and donors are recognized on our site with heartfelt thanks.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.donate.line', 'zhHant', '任何金額的捐款都將直接支持我們的使命——iHear 團隊與老師衷心感謝您的支持與信任！', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.donate.line', 'zhHans', '任何金额的捐款都将直接支持我们的使命——iHear 团队与老师衷心感谢您的支持与信任！', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.donate.subtitle', 'en', 'Your support creates life-changing opportunities for students with communication needs. Every donation, regardless of amount, is an investment in students'' futures.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.donate.subtitle', 'zhHant', '您的每一份支持，都在為有溝通需求的學生創造改變的機會——每一份捐款，無論金額大小，都是對學生未來的投資。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.donate.subtitle', 'zhHans', '您的每一份支持，都在为有沟通需求的学生创造改变的机会——每一份捐款，无论金额大小，都是对学生未来的投资。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.donor.body', 'en', 'We are building our donor list. Your name could be here! Donors are recognized in tiers: Founding Donors, Major ($500+), Supporting ($100–$499), and Friends of iHear.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.donor.body', 'zhHant', '我們正在建立捐贈者名單，您的名字可以在這裡！捐贈者將依級別致謝：創始捐贈者、主要捐贈者（$500+）、支持捐贈者（$100–$499）與 iHear 之友。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.donor.body', 'zhHans', '我们正在建立捐赠者名单，您的名字可以在这里！捐赠者将按级别致谢：创始捐赠者、主要捐赠者（$500+）、支持捐赠者（$100–$499）与 iHear 之友。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
