  ('/__global__', 'shared.q2', 'en', 'Thank you to the team for nurturing so many outstanding young tutors, enabling Xue Yao to willingly restart full English immersion classes.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q2', 'zhHant', '「感謝團隊培育出這麼多優秀的年輕導師，讓學曜願意重新開始全英語沉浸式課程。」', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q2', 'zhHans', '「感谢团队培育出这么多优秀的年轻导师，让学曜愿意重新开始全英语沉浸式课程。」', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q2.by', 'en', '— Parent of X.Y., Taiwan', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q2.by', 'zhHant', '— X.Y. 家長（臺灣）', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q2.by', 'zhHans', '— X.Y. 家长（台湾）', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q3', 'en', 'The tutors first had me read aloud. Then they slowed down and read it as a demonstration, hoping I would spot the differences and correct myself. Kevin is now less fearful and reads aloud more fluently.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q3', 'zhHant', '「老師會先讓我朗讀，然後放慢速度示範朗讀，希望我觀察、找出差異並嘗試自我修正。Kevin 現在不再害怕，朗讀也更流利了。」', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q3', 'zhHans', '「老师会先让我朗读，然后放慢速度示范朗读，希望我观察、找出差异并尝试自我修正。Kevin 现在不再害怕，朗读也更流利了。」', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q3.by', 'en', '— Parent of K.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q3.by', 'zhHant', '— K. 的家長', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q3.by', 'zhHans', '— K. 的家长', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q4', 'en', 'After just one or two classes, you genuinely feel an urgent desire to speak English fluently. The teacher is incredibly patient. Thank you.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q4', 'zhHant', '「老師非常有耐心，而且真正理解我孩子的需求。我們看到了顯著的進步，不僅是在英語能力上，更重要的是在自信心上。」', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/__global__', 'shared.q4', 'zhHans', '「老师非常有耐心，而且真正理解我孩子的需求。我们看到了显著的进步，不仅是在英语能力上，更重要的是在自信心上。」', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
