  ('/academy', 'academy.acad.p1', 'en', 'iHear Academy is a mission-aligned paid tutoring program. Program revenue supports tutor compensation, training, and curriculum development, while surplus funds are reinvested into the iHear Program to expand free services for learners with hearing and communication needs.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/academy', 'academy.acad.p1', 'zhHant', 'iHear Academy 是與使命一致的付費輔導計畫。計畫收入用於導師報酬、培訓與課程開發，盈餘則再投入 iHear Program，擴大為聽力與溝通需求學習者提供的免費服務。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/academy', 'academy.acad.p1', 'zhHans', 'iHear Academy 是与使命一致的付费辅导项目。项目收入用于导师报酬、培训与课程开发，盈余则再投入 iHear Program，扩大为听力与沟通需求学习者提供的免费服务。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/academy', 'academy.acad.p2', 'en', 'The Academy focuses on practical core competencies: pronunciation, speaking fluency, listening comprehension, vocabulary, and above all, the confidence to speak up, in an immersive environment where students progress from "learning English" to "learning in English." 93% satisfaction rate.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/academy', 'academy.acad.p2', 'zhHant', 'Academy 專注於最實用的核心能力：發音、口說流利度、聽力理解、詞彙，以及最重要的——敢於開口的自信。在沉浸式環境中，學生從「學習英文」進步到「用英文學習」。滿意度達 93%。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/academy', 'academy.acad.p2', 'zhHans', 'Academy 专注于最实用的核心能力：发音、口语流利度、听力理解、词汇，以及最重要的——敢于开口的自信。在沉浸式环境中，学生从『学习英文』进步到『用英文学习』。满意度达 93%。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
