  ('/contact', 'contact.contact.subtitle', 'en', 'Have questions? Want to get involved? Reach out any time, in English or Chinese.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/contact', 'contact.contact.subtitle', 'zhHant', '有任何問題？想加入我們？歡迎隨時聯繫——中英文皆可。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/contact', 'contact.contact.subtitle', 'zhHans', '有任何问题？想加入我们？欢迎随时联系——中英文皆可。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f10a', 'en', 'Our tutors are dedicated high school students who volunteer their time to support students with hearing loss. All are passionate about inclusive communication and committed to guiding our students in overcoming any barriers to build confidence and proficiency in English communication.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f10a', 'zhHant', '我們的導師是自願奉獻時間、支持聽力損失學生的高中生。他們熱衷於包容性溝通，致力於引導學生克服障礙，建立英語溝通的自信與能力。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f10a', 'zhHans', '我们的导师是自愿奉献时间、支持听力损失学生的高中生。他们热衷于包容性沟通，致力于引导学生克服障碍，建立英语沟通的自信与能力。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f10q', 'en', 'Who are the iHear tutors?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f10q', 'zhHant', 'iHear 的導師是誰？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f10q', 'zhHans', 'iHear 的导师是谁？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f11a', 'en', 'All tutors complete comprehensive training in inclusive communication strategies, working with students with hearing loss, and effective online teaching methods. They learn about cochlear implants, hearing aids, visual communication techniques, and how to create accessible learning environments.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f11a', 'zhHant', '所有導師皆完成包容性溝通策略、聽損學生教學及有效線上教學方法的完整培訓。他們學習人工耳蝸、助聽器、視覺溝通技巧，以及如何打造無障礙的學習環境。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f11a', 'zhHans', '所有导师均完成包容性沟通策略、听损学生教学及有效在线教学方法的完整培训。他们学习人工耳蜗、助听器、视觉沟通技巧，以及如何打造无障碍的学习环境。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f11q', 'en', 'What training do tutors receive?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f11q', 'zhHant', '導師接受什麼培訓？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f11q', 'zhHans', '导师接受什么培训？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f12a', 'en', 'We carefully match students with tutors based on several factors including the student''s age, learning goals, interests, communication needs, and scheduling availability. We aim to create partnerships where both the student and tutor can build a positive, productive relationship.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f12a', 'zhHant', '我們根據學生的年齡、學習目標、興趣、溝通需求與時間安排等多項因素細心配對，力求建立讓學生與導師都能正向成長的夥伴關係。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f12a', 'zhHans', '我们根据学生的年龄、学习目标、兴趣、沟通需求与时间安排等多项因素细心匹配，力求建立让学生与导师都能正向成长的伙伴关系。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f12q', 'en', 'How are students matched with tutors?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f12q', 'zhHant', '如何為學生配對導師？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f12q', 'zhHans', '如何为学生匹配导师？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f13a', 'en', 'We continuously monitor tutor-student pairings to ensure effective learning experiences. If you have any concerns or questions about the pairing, please reach out to us at ihearprogram@gmail.com. We''re here to discuss your concerns and work together to find the best solution for your child''s learning needs.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f13a', 'zhHant', '我們持續追蹤師生配對成效，確保良好的學習體驗。如對配對有任何疑慮，請來信 ihearprogram@gmail.com，我們將與您討論並共同找出最適合孩子的方案。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f13a', 'zhHans', '我们持续跟踪师生配对成效，确保良好的学习体验。如对配对有任何疑虑，请发邮件至 ihearprogram@gmail.com，我们将与您讨论并共同找出最适合孩子的方案。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f13q', 'en', 'What if the tutor-student pairing isn''t working well?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f13q', 'zhHant', '如果師生配對效果不佳怎麼辦？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f13q', 'zhHans', '如果师生配对效果不佳怎么办？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f14a', 'en', 'All tutoring sessions are conducted via Zoom. This platform offers reliable video quality, screen sharing capabilities, and accessibility features like live captions that are particularly helpful for students with hearing loss.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f14a', 'zhHant', '所有輔導課程皆透過 Zoom 進行。該平台提供穩定的視訊品質、螢幕分享功能，以及對聽損學生特別有幫助的即時字幕等無障礙功能。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f14a', 'zhHans', '所有辅导课程均通过 Zoom 进行。该平台提供稳定的视频质量、屏幕共享功能，以及对听损学生特别有帮助的实时字幕等无障碍功能。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f14q', 'en', 'What platform do you use for sessions?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f14q', 'zhHant', '課程使用什麼平台？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f14q', 'zhHans', '课程使用什么平台？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f15a', 'en', 'You''ll need a computer, tablet, or smartphone with a camera and microphone, plus a stable internet connection. We recommend using headphones or earbuds for better audio quality. If your child uses hearing aids or cochlear implants, they should wear them during sessions.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f15a', 'zhHant', '您需要一台有鏡頭與麥克風的電腦、平板或智慧型手機，以及穩定的網路連線。建議使用耳機以獲得更好的音質。若孩子使用助聽器或人工耳蝸，上課時請配戴。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f15a', 'zhHans', '您需要一台有摄像头与麦克风的电脑、平板或智能手机，以及稳定的网络连接。建议使用耳机以获得更好的音质。若孩子使用助听器或人工耳蜗，上课时请佩戴。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f15q', 'en', 'What equipment do we need?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f15q', 'zhHant', '我們需要什麼設備？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f15q', 'zhHans', '我们需要什么设备？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f16a', 'en', 'Technical issues happen! If you experience problems connecting to Zoom or during a session, contact us at ihearprogram@gmail.com. We can help troubleshoot or reschedule the session if needed. Your tutor will also be patient and help resolve minor technical issues.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f16a', 'zhHant', '技術問題難免發生！若連線 Zoom 或上課中遇到問題，請聯繫 ihearprogram@gmail.com。我們可以協助排除問題或改期。導師也會耐心協助解決小型技術狀況。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f16a', 'zhHans', '技术问题难免发生！若连接 Zoom 或上课中遇到问题，请联系 ihearprogram@gmail.com。我们可以协助排查问题或改期。导师也会耐心协助解决小型技术状况。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f16q', 'en', 'What if we have technical difficulties?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f16q', 'zhHant', '遇到技術問題怎麼辦？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f16q', 'zhHans', '遇到技术问题怎么办？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f17a', 'en', 'Matching typically takes 1-2 weeks, depending on tutor availability and your scheduling preferences. We prioritize finding the right fit over speed, ensuring your child is paired with a tutor who can best support their learning goals.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f17a', 'zhHant', '配對通常需要 1–2 週，視導師的時間與您的排程偏好而定。我們重視「找到最合適的導師」勝過速度，確保您的孩子與最能支持其學習目標的導師配對。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f17a', 'zhHans', '匹配通常需要 1–2 周，视导师的时间与您的日程偏好而定。我们重视「找到最合适的导师」胜过速度，确保您的孩子与最能支持其学习目标的导师配对。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f17q', 'en', 'How long does it take to get matched with a tutor?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f17q', 'zhHant', '配對輔導老師需要多久？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f17q', 'zhHans', '匹配辅导老师需要多久？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f18a', 'en', 'The first session is an introduction where the tutor and student get to know each other. They''ll discuss learning goals, interests, and communication preferences. The tutor will assess the student''s current English level and begin planning personalized lessons. Parents are welcome to join the first session.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f18a', 'zhHant', '第一堂課是導師與學生互相認識的時間——討論學習目標、興趣與溝通偏好。導師會評估學生目前的英語程度，並開始規劃個人化課程。歡迎家長一同參與第一堂課。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f18a', 'zhHans', '第一节课是导师与学生互相认识的时间——讨论学习目标、兴趣与沟通偏好。导师会评估学生目前的英语水平，并开始规划个性化课程。欢迎家长一同参加第一节课。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f18q', 'en', 'What happens in the first session?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f18q', 'zhHant', '第一堂課會做什麼？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f18q', 'zhHans', '第一节课会做什么？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f19a', 'en', 'This depends on the student''s age and comfort level. For younger students, parents may want to be nearby for support. Older students often prefer independent sessions. We encourage parents to check in periodically with tutors to discuss progress and any concerns.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f19a', 'zhHant', '這取決於學生的年齡與自在程度。年幼的學生可能希望家長在附近提供支持；年長的學生通常偏好獨立上課。我們鼓勵家長定期與導師交流，了解學習進度。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f19a', 'zhHans', '这取决于学生的年龄与舒适程度。年幼的学生可能希望家长在附近提供支持；年长的学生通常更喜欢独立上课。我们鼓励家长定期与导师交流，了解学习进度。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f19q', 'en', 'Should parents be present during sessions?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f19q', 'zhHant', '課程期間家長需要在場嗎？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f19q', 'zhHans', '课程期间家长需要在场吗？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f1a', 'en', 'Our program is designed for students with hearing loss or other communication needs who want to improve their English communication skills. We welcome students of all ages, from elementary school through high school and beyond. Students with cochlear implants, hearing aids, or any level of hearing loss are encouraged to apply.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f1a', 'zhHant', '本計畫為有聽力損失或其他溝通需求、希望提升英語溝通能力的學生設計。我們歡迎各年齡層的學生，從小學到高中及以上。配戴人工耳蝸、助聽器或任何程度聽力損失的學生都歡迎申請。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f1a', 'zhHans', '本项目为有听力损失或其他沟通需求、希望提升英语沟通能力的学生设计。我们欢迎各年龄段的学生，从小学到高中及以上。佩戴人工耳蜗、助听器或任何程度听力损失的学生都欢迎申请。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f1q', 'en', 'Who is eligible for iHear tutoring?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f1q', 'zhHant', '誰符合 iHear 輔導資格？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f1q', 'zhHans', '谁符合 iHear 辅导资格？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f20a', 'en', 'Curriculum is personalized based on each student''s goals and needs. Common focus areas include pronunciation, conversational English, vocabulary building, reading comprehension, writing skills, and confidence in spoken communication. Tutors adapt lessons to the student''s interests to keep sessions engaging.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f20a', 'zhHant', '課程依每位學生的目標量身打造：發音、英語會話、詞彙累積、閱讀理解、寫作能力，以及口語溝通的自信。導師會結合學生的興趣設計課程，讓學習保持趣味。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f20a', 'zhHans', '课程依每位学生的目标量身定制：发音、英语会话、词汇积累、阅读理解、写作能力，以及口语沟通的自信。导师会结合学生的兴趣设计课程，让学习保持趣味。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f20q', 'en', 'What will my child learn in tutoring sessions?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f20q', 'zhHant', '我的孩子會在輔導課程中學到什麼？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f20q', 'zhHans', '我的孩子会在辅导课程中学到什么？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f2a', 'en', 'No! All iHear tutoring sessions are completely free. Our program is volunteer-driven and supported by community partnerships. We believe every student deserves access to high-quality English communication support regardless of their financial situation.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f2a', 'zhHant', '不需要，所有 iHear 輔導服務對學生和家庭完全免費。我們的計畫由訓練有素的志願導師和社區支持提供支持。我們相信每位學生無論經濟狀況，都應獲得高品質的英語溝通支持。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f2a', 'zhHans', '不需要，所有 iHear 辅导服务对学生和家庭完全免费。我们的项目由训练有素的志愿者导师和社区支持提供支持。我们相信每位学生无论经济状况，都应获得高质量的英语沟通支持。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f2q', 'en', 'Is there any cost for tutoring?', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f2q', 'zhHant', '輔導需要付費嗎？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f2q', 'zhHans', '辅导需要付费吗？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f3a', 'en', 'No! Since all sessions are conducted via Zoom, we can serve students anywhere in the world. We currently have students across 4 countries and work with families in different time zones to find convenient session times.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
