  ('/faq', 'faq.f5q', 'zhHans', '每节课多长？', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f6a', 'en', 'Sessions are typically held once per week on a consistent day and time. This regular schedule helps build routine and allows students to make steady progress. We work with families to find a time that fits their schedule.', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f6a', 'zhHant', '課程通常每週一次，固定在同一天同一時間。規律的時間表有助於建立習慣，讓學生穩定進步。我們會與家庭協調合適的時間。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
  ('/faq', 'faq.f6a', 'zhHans', '课程通常每周一次，固定在同一天同一时间。规律的时间表有助于建立习惯，让学生稳定进步。我们会与家庭协调合适的时间。', NOW(), 'migration-013'),
